# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages: Opcode's WebAssembly runtime needs a
# cross-origin isolated page (SharedArrayBuffer). No other site may frame the
# app (clickjacking); previews are framed from the preview host, which has its
# own headers (scripts/preview-host.mjs).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
